{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2021-07-19 17:38:00', 'title': 'FIRST SOLAR APPOINTS ANITA MARANGOLY GEORGE TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "TEMPE, ARIZ., JULY 19, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQ: FSLR) HAS APPOINTED ANITA MARANGOLY GEORGE, A SENIOR EXECUTIVE WITH ALMOST FOUR DECADES OF DIVERSE GLOBAL EXPERIENCE IN INSTITUTIONAL FINANCE AND SUSTAINABLE INFRASTRUCTURE INVESTING, TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE JULY 15, 2021. MS. GEORGE WILL SERVE ON FIRST SOLAR'S NOMINATING AND GOVERNANCE, AND TECHNOLOGY COMMITTEES."}